        "id": 1233564
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-23T10:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mSubscriptionManager keeps information about if roaming is allowed or not. Previously this only changed when the user toggled the roaming switch. When we introduce national roaming this can change every time we move to a new roaming network. We therefore need to call updateRoamingSubscription here in order to potentially update mSubscriptionManager with information if roaming is allowed or not.",
      "parentUuid": "324ddd97_21772513",
